mbell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nCasting the skill grants Lily <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> for 6s. Casting Outro Skill consumes <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151202>Silvered Dream</te></color> to Resonators in the team. This effect can be triggered once every 20s.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to grant 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>. During the skill, she pulls in nearby targets and continuously deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to them. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> stops the skill immediately.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> during the skill.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to stop the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color>. <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> is automatically cast at the end of <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nCasting this skill grants Lily <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> for 6s. Casting Outro Skill consumes <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151202>Silvered Dream</te></color> to Resonators in the team. This effect can be triggered once every 20s.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Silvered Dream</color></size>\nLasts for 30s.\nWhen the Resonator with this effect is the Active Resonator and can trigger Unison Response, each stack of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> on the team increases their ATK by 0.1% for every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen above 190%, up to 7%, counting up to 4 stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color>.\nThe active Resonator's Echo Skill Crit. Rate and Echo Skill Crit. DMG are increased. Every 0.7% of Lily's Energy Regen above 190% increases Echo Skill Crit. Rate by 0.1%, up to 10%. Every 0.7% of Lily's Energy Regen above 190% increases Echo Skill Crit. DMG by 0.2%, up to 20%.\nAll Resonators in the team gain resistance to interruption.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Dream Shelter</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> grants 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>, stacking up to 1 time. Receiving damage from an enemy target consumes 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color> to grant Lily immunity to interruption and reduce the DMG taken by 60% for 1s. This effect can be triggered once every 1s.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Wish of Praying Dream</color></size>\nCan be gained once every 25s.\nWhen Lily has <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>, this <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color> to increase the skill's healing by 400%.",
   "Skill_1006307_SkillName": "Dreamland of Flowers",
   "Skill_1006307_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Forte Gauge</color></size>\nCan be restored in the following ways:\n- Hitting an enemy with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color>, or <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color>.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Forte Gauge</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color></size>\nDeal <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>. During the skill, Lily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> and heals all Resonators in the team every second.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> is full, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to consume all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color></size>\nDeal <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>. Lily gains <color=Highlight>Sillage</color>. Casting Outro Skill consumes <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> and grants <color=Highlight>Silvered Dream</color> to all Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color></size>\nDeal <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>. During the skill, Lily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> and heals all Resonators in the team every second.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> is full, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to consume all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color></size>\nDeal <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>. Lily gains <color=Highlight>Sillage</color>. Casting Outro Skill consumes <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> and grants <color=Highlight>Silvered Dream</color> to all Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Silvered Dream</color></size>\nWhen the Resonator with this effect is the Active Resonator and can trigger Unison Response, their ATK is increased based on the <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> stack count on the team.\nThe active Resonator's Echo Skill Crit. Rate and Echo Skill Crit. DMG are increased.",
